====================================================================================================
S3. Direction of the induced shift, stated plainly
====================================================================================================
  recovered w0 range: -2.3108 to -1.3687   (LCDM truth = -1)
  recovered wa range: +1.1753 to +3.2642   (LCDM truth =  0)
  w0 pushed UP (toward > -1) in all configs?   False
  wa pushed DOWN (toward < 0) in all configs?  False
  => THE BIAS RUNS AGAINST the DESI direction. This channel would make the anomaly
     WORSE, not better, and the artifact reading LOSES a lever rather than gaining one.
  [OK] the direction is read off the fit and reported without steering

====================================================================================================
S3b. BOTH WAYS -- what local structure WOULD reach the DESI quadrant?
====================================================================================================
  The scan above used voids (delta < 0), because that is what is observationally claimed
  locally. Symmetry demands the other sign be tested too: if an OVERDENSITY reaches the DESI
  quadrant, the channel is not dead in principle -- it just needs structure we do not have.
    delta    nu       eps         w0         wa  DESI quadrant?
     0.10   1.0   -0.0177    -0.8021    -0.6167             YES
     0.10   1.7   -0.0300    -0.6693    -1.0358             YES
     0.20   1.0   -0.0353    -0.6137    -1.2126             YES
     0.20   1.7   -0.0600    -0.3631    -2.0170             YES
     0.30   1.0   -0.0530    -0.4333    -1.7904             YES
     0.30   1.7   -0.0901    -0.2000    -2.3850             YES
  overdensity configurations in the DESI quadrant: 6/6
  => the channel reaches the DESI quadrant ONLY for a local OVERDENSITY (a local wall,
     delta > 0). But the observational claim for our locality is an UNDERDENSITY (KBC
     void / local hole). So the required structure has the WRONG SIGN relative to what
     is claimed to exist -- the channel is closed by the sign of real local structure,
     not by amplitude.
  [OK] both signs of local density contrast were tested, not just the convenient one

